WEBVTT

00:00:40.541 --> 00:00:43.961
FLEX X COP 2

00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:46.797
CHARACTERS, PLACES, ORGANIZATIONS,
AND EVENTS IN THIS DRAMA ARE FICTITIOUS

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.966
ALL CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS
FILMED IN A SAFE ENVIRONMENT

00:01:18.161 --> 00:01:20.414
THE LATE JEONG MINJAE

00:02:06.918 --> 00:02:08.545
Why did you do that?

00:02:09.421 --> 00:02:13.258
Minjae isn't even a detective anymore.

00:02:14.092 --> 00:02:15.093
Why?

00:02:15.927 --> 00:02:19.139
He's not a cop!

00:02:20.015 --> 00:02:22.476
My poor Minjae. What am I going to do?

00:02:22.559 --> 00:02:25.771
[sobbing] Minjae.

00:02:26.730 --> 00:02:28.690
[wails] Minjae!

00:02:29.608 --> 00:02:31.693
Minjae!

00:02:39.785 --> 00:02:41.453
Minjae!

00:02:43.747 --> 00:02:46.833
-[voice shaking] I'm sorry.
-Minjae!

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:49.127
I'm so sorry.

00:02:55.676 --> 00:02:59.096
GANGHA JUNGANG HOSPITAL FUNERAL HALL

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:02.683
Ah. I'll catch up with you later.

00:03:03.266 --> 00:03:04.267
Okay.

00:03:05.936 --> 00:03:07.521
EPISODE 13

00:03:34.756 --> 00:03:37.259
THE LITTLE PRINCE

00:03:41.805 --> 00:03:43.473
[Seongwon] Don't run away from this.

00:03:43.557 --> 00:03:47.018
Once you accept it,
you'll finally be free.

00:03:50.564 --> 00:03:54.067
After all, you're my Little Prince.

00:04:00.866 --> 00:04:03.994
THE LITTLE PRINCE

00:04:25.474 --> 00:04:27.601
I HAD TO DRAW THE INSIDE
OF THE BOA CONSTRICTOR

00:04:27.684 --> 00:04:29.936
YOU ALWAYS HAVE
TO EXPLAIN EVERYTHING TO GROWN-UPS

00:04:32.147 --> 00:04:34.065
[Seongwon] The moment I first met you
is one of them.

00:04:34.649 --> 00:04:35.650
Me?

00:04:37.402 --> 00:04:38.487
At the gathering?

00:04:39.321 --> 00:04:42.199
You don't remember, do you?

00:04:42.908 --> 00:04:44.242
We met way before that.

00:04:44.951 --> 00:04:46.369
When I was just a kid.

00:04:46.453 --> 00:04:48.455
I've liked you ever since then.

00:04:51.708 --> 00:04:53.335
Back then,

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:55.796
you were a lot quieter than you are now.

00:04:58.006 --> 00:05:00.884
You were shorter and thinner.

00:05:01.885 --> 00:05:04.137
The hallway was bright,

00:05:06.223 --> 00:05:09.267
and a breeze was
coming in through the window.

00:05:09.351 --> 00:05:11.353
SEO YUKYUNG PSYCHIATRIC CLINIC

00:05:36.336 --> 00:05:38.129
[Seongwon] How's my drawing?

00:05:40.674 --> 00:05:41.675
It's really good.

00:05:41.758 --> 00:05:43.552
Do you know what this is?

00:05:44.177 --> 00:05:45.470
It's a puppy.

00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:49.391
[Seongwon] My picture.

00:05:50.433 --> 00:05:52.644
Everyone said it was weird.

00:05:52.727 --> 00:05:55.188
You were the only person
who complimented me.

00:05:57.649 --> 00:05:58.650
[Dr. Seo] Jin Isoo.

00:05:59.860 --> 00:06:01.403
Come inside.

00:06:16.835 --> 00:06:18.837
KEEP QUIET

00:06:31.099 --> 00:06:32.517
Yu Seongwon.

00:06:34.019 --> 00:06:35.020
Do you remember him?

00:06:38.106 --> 00:06:39.190
Yu Seongwon?

00:06:46.323 --> 00:06:47.616
Did he kill someone?

00:06:50.368 --> 00:06:51.661
What makes you think that?

00:06:53.455 --> 00:06:55.749
Because he was
captivated by death as a child.

00:06:57.792 --> 00:07:00.670
He first came to my clinic

00:07:01.713 --> 00:07:03.214
when he was nine years old.

00:07:08.803 --> 00:07:10.138
SEO YUKYUNG PSYCHIATRIC CLINIC

00:07:10.221 --> 00:07:11.222
Him.

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:15.477
Can you make him normal?

00:07:19.731 --> 00:07:21.107
I think he's insane.

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:40.251
Move.

00:07:42.045 --> 00:07:43.213
Out of my way!

00:07:44.047 --> 00:07:47.425
-[screams]
-Mom, what do you think you're doing?

00:08:02.816 --> 00:08:04.401
Jackie is dead.

00:08:04.484 --> 00:08:05.485
JACKIE

00:08:05.568 --> 00:08:06.653
You know, don't you?

00:08:18.915 --> 00:08:20.333
Did Jackie bite you?

00:08:20.417 --> 00:08:21.876
He always does.

00:08:22.627 --> 00:08:24.337
Apparently, he thinks he's above me.

00:08:27.132 --> 00:08:28.299
I see.

00:08:30.135 --> 00:08:31.428
You must've resented Jackie.

00:08:47.193 --> 00:08:48.403
After Jackie died,

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:50.613
how did you feel?

00:08:51.322 --> 00:08:52.449
It was nice.

00:08:53.616 --> 00:08:56.995
He doesn't bark or bite me anymore.

00:08:57.662 --> 00:08:59.080
He listens to me now.

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:08.256
Can you draw Jackie for me?

00:09:31.654 --> 00:09:33.740
He never once drew a dog that was alive.

00:09:35.909 --> 00:09:38.703
Still, he got better
with art therapy and counseling,

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:41.122
and nothing happened for a while,

00:09:42.123 --> 00:09:44.793
but it flared up again
after the chairman passed away.

00:09:49.964 --> 00:09:51.216
He saw the dead body

00:09:51.966 --> 00:09:53.259
and was inspired.

00:10:15.323 --> 00:10:16.449
What's going on?

00:10:16.533 --> 00:10:18.451
Your son has locked the door.

00:10:21.496 --> 00:10:22.664
Yu Seongwon!

00:10:23.915 --> 00:10:25.458
[yelling] Yu Seongwon!

00:10:27.919 --> 00:10:29.379
-[knocking on door]
-Open the door.

00:10:29.462 --> 00:10:31.714
[yelling] Yu Seongwon, open the door!

00:10:45.770 --> 00:10:46.771
What do you think?

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:49.149
The title is "Marionette."

00:10:56.322 --> 00:10:57.991
[softly] Crazy bastard.

00:10:58.616 --> 00:10:59.868
Do you like it?

00:10:59.951 --> 00:11:01.828
Get this crazy bastard out of here.

00:11:05.915 --> 00:11:08.251
Stop it! Let go!

00:11:08.334 --> 00:11:10.253
No, seriously!

00:11:11.588 --> 00:11:13.047
Stop it!

00:11:13.131 --> 00:11:14.382
Let go of me!

00:11:16.342 --> 00:11:17.886
Nothing...

00:11:22.515 --> 00:11:24.350
happened here.

00:11:26.269 --> 00:11:27.687
If this gets out,

00:11:32.692 --> 00:11:34.277
this hospital is finished.

00:11:35.528 --> 00:11:36.821
We'll be careful, ma'am.

00:11:38.781 --> 00:11:41.367
Take this off! [exclaims, screams]

00:11:41.451 --> 00:11:42.535
Take it off!

00:11:44.245 --> 00:11:46.873
[Dr. Seo] In the end, he was
hospitalized for a very long time.

00:11:52.337 --> 00:11:53.546
[Dr. Seo] I helped Seongwon

00:11:54.547 --> 00:11:56.174
channel his fantasies about death

00:11:56.257 --> 00:11:58.426
into works of art.

00:12:01.971 --> 00:12:04.057
I heard he became a famous artist.

00:12:07.685 --> 00:12:09.646
What exactly did he do?

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:12.857
He's been involved in six cases so far.

00:12:14.108 --> 00:12:15.276
Two were his models.

00:12:16.069 --> 00:12:18.446
He's killing people to create his pieces.

00:12:23.368 --> 00:12:25.870
It looks like
my treatment failed after all.

00:12:29.457 --> 00:12:31.459
You know Seongwon likes you, don't you?

00:12:34.462 --> 00:12:36.464
He said you alone understood him.

00:12:39.008 --> 00:12:41.052
What is his weakness?

00:12:45.473 --> 00:12:46.641
Please help me.

00:12:48.518 --> 00:12:49.519
His weakness?

00:12:55.942 --> 00:12:58.736
There was one final piece he made
while he was hospitalized.

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:00.280
It was also of a dog.

00:13:13.293 --> 00:13:15.461
Jackie's collar was wrapped around it.

00:13:17.130 --> 00:13:18.464
Then, even now,

00:13:20.133 --> 00:13:22.093
he must have the victims' belongings.

00:13:24.137 --> 00:13:26.431
To relive the thrill of his killings,

00:13:27.223 --> 00:13:29.225
I'm sure that somewhere,

00:13:29.309 --> 00:13:31.894
he would have displayed
his victims' belongings.

00:13:32.937 --> 00:13:34.022
Like works of art.

00:13:42.155 --> 00:13:44.866
JO NAYEONG, CHOI YEONGMIN,
KIM HEEJUN, JEONG MINJAE

00:13:44.949 --> 00:13:47.285
YU SEONGWON
UBS CHAIRWOMAN'S SON, FAMOUS SCULPTOR

00:13:55.918 --> 00:13:57.837
The day before she went missing,

00:13:57.920 --> 00:14:00.757
Jo Nayeong went
to Yu Seongwon's studio in his car.

00:14:00.840 --> 00:14:04.052
On the 12th, he dropped her off at CONEX.

00:14:05.720 --> 00:14:08.056
She was last seen
on camera in the corridor.

00:14:08.681 --> 00:14:10.933
But there's no footage
of her leaving CONEX.

00:14:11.893 --> 00:14:14.979
[Junyoung] Choi Yeongmin said
he had his modeling job on the eighth.

00:14:15.063 --> 00:14:16.731
The next morning, on the ninth,

00:14:16.814 --> 00:14:20.401
he drove his car from the studio,
parked it, then disappeared.

00:14:20.985 --> 00:14:24.280
And Kim Heejun said he was
going to meet Yu Seongwon.

00:14:24.363 --> 00:14:26.657
[Kyungjin] But he left his car
at Deoksan-ri and disappeared.

00:14:27.742 --> 00:14:30.745
Lastly, Jeong Minjae,
who was following Yu Seongwon...

00:14:31.454 --> 00:14:34.082
[Kyungjin] His car was found
near the Hangang River.

00:14:34.874 --> 00:14:36.626
They all follow a similar pattern.

00:14:36.709 --> 00:14:39.462
The victims were all with Yu Seongwon,

00:14:39.545 --> 00:14:42.215
then the next day, in a crowded place,

00:14:42.924 --> 00:14:46.552
or somewhere too far out
for the camera to make out their face,

00:14:47.261 --> 00:14:48.763
they left their car and vanished.

00:14:48.846 --> 00:14:51.182
Then when and how did he kill them?

00:14:51.265 --> 00:14:55.228
Did Yu Seongwon lure them
into meeting him again somewhere else?

00:14:55.311 --> 00:14:57.355
But for the days the victims went missing,

00:14:57.438 --> 00:14:59.273
Yu Seongwon has a solid alibi.

00:15:03.945 --> 00:15:05.696
JEONG MINJAE DETECTIVE AGENCY
CEO JEONG MINJAE

00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:07.532
SHADOW WITHOUT A TRACE
TRACK TO THE END

00:15:31.472 --> 00:15:32.890
-[mouse clicks]
-[sighs heavily]

00:15:42.859 --> 00:15:45.027
YU SEONGWON
JEONG MINJAE

00:15:52.994 --> 00:15:55.580
VEHICLE STOP LOCATION
65, EUNDAM-RO 13BEON-GIL, GANGHA-GU

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:01.085
ALL NOTES

00:16:01.169 --> 00:16:03.754
SONG AREUM
65, EUNDAM-RO 13BEON-GIL, GANGHA-GU

00:16:05.256 --> 00:16:07.091
65, EUNDAM-RO 13BEON-GIL, GANGHA-GU

00:16:15.141 --> 00:16:17.852
-Hey, you're here.
-Did you see all the files?

00:16:17.935 --> 00:16:18.978
Yeah.

00:16:19.562 --> 00:16:21.564
But all the victims were still alive

00:16:21.647 --> 00:16:23.733
the day after they met Yu Seongwon.

00:16:23.816 --> 00:16:26.319
We can't figure out
when and how he killed them.

00:16:28.404 --> 00:16:29.739
Our theory is...

00:16:34.202 --> 00:16:35.745
that this person is Yu Seongwon.

00:16:37.496 --> 00:16:41.209
The victims were probably killed
on the day they met Yu Seongwon.

00:16:42.793 --> 00:16:45.463
He wanted to leave proof
they were alive the next day,

00:16:46.881 --> 00:16:48.549
so Yu Seongwon went out himself.

00:16:52.136 --> 00:16:54.180
He put on their clothes to look like them,

00:17:02.021 --> 00:17:03.564
went to a crowded place,

00:17:09.612 --> 00:17:10.696
and then disappeared.

00:17:14.825 --> 00:17:17.620
That's why these were classified
as missing-person cases.

00:17:17.703 --> 00:17:21.040
Yeah, that makes more sense.

00:17:21.123 --> 00:17:22.208
[softly] Wow!

00:17:22.708 --> 00:17:25.586
He's one scary guy, that Yu Seongwon.

00:17:33.386 --> 00:17:35.179
-[Areum] Yu Seongwon?

00:17:35.263 --> 00:17:37.473
No, he didn't come here.

00:17:38.057 --> 00:17:39.267
Ah, I see.

00:17:41.352 --> 00:17:43.688
Are there security cameras
in this building?

00:17:45.856 --> 00:17:48.150
There's one on the first floor,

00:17:48.901 --> 00:17:49.902
but it's broken.

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:52.863
I kept asking them to fix it,
but they never did.

00:17:54.156 --> 00:17:56.576
Why do you ask?

00:17:57.326 --> 00:17:59.495
My colleague,
who was following Yu Seongwon,

00:18:00.705 --> 00:18:01.956
died.

00:18:03.791 --> 00:18:05.751
I think he was kidnapped around here.

00:18:05.835 --> 00:18:06.836
[Areum] Oh, my God.

00:18:06.919 --> 00:18:08.713
Was Yu Seongwon behind it?

00:18:09.422 --> 00:18:10.631
That's very likely.

00:18:14.844 --> 00:18:17.138
Come to think of it, that day,

00:18:18.264 --> 00:18:20.391
just after I'd arrived home,

00:18:20.474 --> 00:18:22.643
I heard something strange.

00:19:09.482 --> 00:19:11.150
If this is Yu Seongwon,

00:19:13.778 --> 00:19:15.196
who drove this car?

00:19:15.905 --> 00:19:18.824
I don't know who it is,
but it means he has an accomplice.

00:19:23.788 --> 00:19:25.289
I know who the accomplice is.

00:19:37.802 --> 00:19:39.220
This is...

00:19:39.303 --> 00:19:40.304
[Hyera] Yes.

00:19:41.097 --> 00:19:43.391
The man who's always
by Yu Seongwon's side, right?

00:19:46.102 --> 00:19:48.020
That man lives with him in the studio,

00:19:48.646 --> 00:19:50.731
so I figured he would know something.

00:19:51.565 --> 00:19:52.858
But he was an accomplice.

00:19:52.942 --> 00:19:54.193
Do you know who he is?

00:19:54.819 --> 00:19:56.696
Not really. He's just called "Mr. Hwang."

00:19:57.655 --> 00:20:00.658
He's looked after the Yu family's villa
since Seongwon was a child.

00:20:00.741 --> 00:20:02.493
His studio used to be their villa.

00:20:05.204 --> 00:20:06.580
Whatever Yu Seongwon says,

00:20:07.581 --> 00:20:08.833
that man obeys.

00:20:10.084 --> 00:20:12.378
Hey, Hwang. Bring me some more chocolate.

00:20:14.839 --> 00:20:17.425
Hey, aren't you being a bit too rude?

00:20:17.508 --> 00:20:18.884
Don't call him "Hwang."

00:20:18.968 --> 00:20:20.636
But I don't know his name.

00:20:21.887 --> 00:20:23.389
It's fine. He's my servant.

00:20:25.349 --> 00:20:28.018
His father was also
a servant to my family.

00:20:28.102 --> 00:20:31.313
But he messed up big time and almost died,

00:20:31.397 --> 00:20:32.815
then my dad saved him.

00:20:40.489 --> 00:20:42.616
That's why he's my servant.

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:43.868
Right, Hwang?

00:20:45.494 --> 00:20:46.579
Yes, Young Master.

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:54.879
First, let's check UBS's employee list.

00:20:54.962 --> 00:20:56.046
Okay.

00:20:56.130 --> 00:20:58.632
-Check who's registered at the studio.
-Got it.

00:21:08.851 --> 00:21:09.852
Are you okay?

00:21:15.399 --> 00:21:17.943
I'm just going to focus
on catching Yu Seongwon for now.

00:21:19.111 --> 00:21:20.529
Right, let's do that.

00:21:26.827 --> 00:21:28.621
UBS EMPLOYEE LIST

00:21:29.497 --> 00:21:30.748
REGISTERED RESIDENTS RECORD

00:21:33.417 --> 00:21:35.294
-Did you find him?

00:21:35.377 --> 00:21:38.130
He's not here. Not in the employee list,
or at the address.

00:21:38.756 --> 00:21:40.591
Let's just bring him in for questioning.

00:21:41.300 --> 00:21:43.135
If he gets out after that, he might run.

00:21:44.011 --> 00:21:45.638
Should I go talk to him?

00:21:47.932 --> 00:21:50.100
I don't know if that's the right approach.

00:21:50.976 --> 00:21:54.104
If he's completely on Yu Seongwon's side,
it might backfire on us.

00:21:56.565 --> 00:21:58.859
We need a reason to make a move.

00:22:14.041 --> 00:22:16.168
The inside of the car
has been wiped clean.

00:22:20.673 --> 00:22:22.633
-Sir.
-What is it?

00:22:36.230 --> 00:22:37.314
Yes, sir.

00:22:39.108 --> 00:22:41.610
Right. Please send it over right away.

00:22:42.945 --> 00:22:44.905
We found a fingerprint
on Jeong Minjae's car.

00:22:59.753 --> 00:23:01.964
NAME, HWANG JONGSU
CRIMINAL RECORD, 4 PRIORS

00:23:03.215 --> 00:23:05.718
Hwang Jongsu, age 59.

00:23:06.343 --> 00:23:08.304
[Isoo] He's a former gang member

00:23:08.387 --> 00:23:10.347
with priors for drugs and fatal assault.

00:23:10.431 --> 00:23:11.432
Let's go bring him in.

00:23:11.515 --> 00:23:12.516
-[Junyoung] Okay.
-[Kyungjin] Okay.

00:23:12.600 --> 00:23:14.184
DETECTIVE DIVISION

00:23:22.693 --> 00:23:25.195
1 DAY EARLIER

00:23:31.160 --> 00:23:32.995
Do you know where Police Chief Hwang is?

00:23:33.537 --> 00:23:36.123
Yes, he's in prison.

00:23:37.833 --> 00:23:39.501
That's not someone else's problem.

00:23:39.585 --> 00:23:41.295
It could happen to you, too.

00:23:43.297 --> 00:23:45.591
Even if you lived
an honest life in public service,

00:23:45.674 --> 00:23:47.384
I can make that happen to you.

00:23:49.511 --> 00:23:53.140
But I doubt you were that honest.

00:23:58.979 --> 00:24:00.606
Leave my son alone.

00:24:02.566 --> 00:24:04.193
Keep me updated on the investigation.

00:24:22.378 --> 00:24:23.379
DETECTIVE DIVISION

00:24:23.462 --> 00:24:25.422
VIOLENT CRIME INVESTIGATION
TEAM 1, TEAM 2

00:24:44.858 --> 00:24:45.859
Yes, sir.

00:24:45.943 --> 00:24:47.945
[Taegyun] So, how did it go?

00:24:49.405 --> 00:24:51.657
Fingerprint? You found a fingerprint?

00:24:51.740 --> 00:24:54.868
Yes, sir. Team 1 has identified him.

00:24:54.952 --> 00:24:57.079
His name is Hwang Jongsu.

00:25:00.541 --> 00:25:02.668
Right, okay.

00:25:03.585 --> 00:25:05.587
FINGERPRINT SEARCH RESULTS
NAME, HWANG JONGSU

00:25:14.763 --> 00:25:16.932
-Hello?
-[Taegyun] Hello, ma'am?

00:25:17.016 --> 00:25:20.227
I don't think you need to worry anymore.

00:25:20.310 --> 00:25:22.021
We have a suspect now.

00:25:22.730 --> 00:25:24.440
His name is Hwang Jongsu.

00:25:25.357 --> 00:25:26.734
He has a criminal record.

00:25:47.504 --> 00:25:49.381
JEONG TAESEON
MR. HWANG HAS BEEN FLAGGED

00:26:06.982 --> 00:26:08.275
[Seongwon] Have you finished eating?

00:26:10.069 --> 00:26:12.154
Yes, I've finished. [clearing throat]

00:26:16.575 --> 00:26:17.743
[gulps] Yes.

00:26:18.660 --> 00:26:22.206
I heard you owe my dad big time.

00:26:22.289 --> 00:26:23.332
Yes.

00:26:24.583 --> 00:26:26.085
He saved my life.

00:26:26.168 --> 00:26:27.377
[Seongwon] Mmm.

00:26:29.129 --> 00:26:30.964
I heard that before he died,

00:26:31.757 --> 00:26:35.010
he told you to protect me no matter what.

00:26:35.094 --> 00:26:37.638
Yes, that's right.

00:26:38.347 --> 00:26:39.348
Now's that time.

00:26:45.437 --> 00:26:47.481
Time to repay what you owe.

00:26:55.280 --> 00:26:57.157
Run for your life.

00:26:59.034 --> 00:27:00.160
Make sure...

00:27:02.913 --> 00:27:04.248
you don't get caught.

00:27:23.350 --> 00:27:24.977
-[engine revs]
-[tires screech]

00:27:27.563 --> 00:27:28.897
Hey, turn the car around.

00:27:28.981 --> 00:27:30.065
Hwang Jongsu.

00:28:03.015 --> 00:28:04.224
-[engine revving]
-[tires screech]

00:28:07.895 --> 00:28:09.980
Hwang Jongsu, stop the car!

00:28:10.063 --> 00:28:12.566
Mr. Hwang! Stop the car!

00:28:12.649 --> 00:28:15.319
Hwang Jongsu, stop the car!

00:28:15.736 --> 00:28:17.112
-[tires screech]
-[metallic crunch]

00:28:17.195 --> 00:28:19.406
-[Isoo grunts]
-[tires screeching]

00:28:20.741 --> 00:28:22.242
-[all grunt]
-[Isoo panting]

00:28:22.326 --> 00:28:24.328
-[engine revving]
-[tires screeching]

00:28:26.079 --> 00:28:27.497
-Follow him.
-[Kyungjin] Yes, ma'am.

00:29:05.077 --> 00:29:06.453
He's not here.

00:29:11.375 --> 00:29:12.960
-That way.
-Right.

00:29:38.151 --> 00:29:40.237
[Mr. Hwang, panting] Ma'am, it's me.

00:29:40.320 --> 00:29:41.321
Where are you?

00:29:42.114 --> 00:29:43.949
The Myeongun-dong construction site.

00:29:44.032 --> 00:29:45.158
[Taeseon] That's not far.

00:29:45.742 --> 00:29:47.452
-Wait there.
-Yes, ma'am.

00:30:14.521 --> 00:30:15.522
Mr. Hwang!

00:30:24.573 --> 00:30:25.699
Young Master.

00:30:27.659 --> 00:30:28.660
Can we

00:30:29.786 --> 00:30:30.829
please talk?

00:30:31.705 --> 00:30:32.789
Please go ahead.

00:30:41.214 --> 00:30:44.342
We got a suicidal person.
Myeongun-dong construction site. Hurry.

00:30:46.178 --> 00:30:47.179
We're not here

00:30:49.097 --> 00:30:50.724
to arrest you.

00:30:52.267 --> 00:30:54.227
I've done a lot of bad things in my life.

00:30:55.771 --> 00:30:57.272
I deserve to die.

00:30:57.355 --> 00:30:58.690
Mr. Hwang Jongsu.

00:31:00.859 --> 00:31:02.527
You care about Yu Seongwon, right?

00:31:03.028 --> 00:31:04.029
I do.

00:31:05.781 --> 00:31:06.990
As much as my own life.

00:31:09.493 --> 00:31:11.036
Before the chairman passed away,

00:31:12.287 --> 00:31:14.247
he made me promise.

00:31:14.331 --> 00:31:16.958
Then we need to stop him
from killing more people.

00:31:17.042 --> 00:31:18.085
That's...

00:31:20.170 --> 00:31:21.880
not something we can stop.

00:31:24.341 --> 00:31:25.342
First,

00:31:27.344 --> 00:31:28.512
just come this way.

00:31:32.974 --> 00:31:34.392
Come talk with me.

00:31:35.227 --> 00:31:36.311
[Mr. Hwang] Young Master.

00:31:37.521 --> 00:31:40.482
The chairman said to me

00:31:42.359 --> 00:31:44.653
that I should let Seongwon
do whatever he wants.

00:31:48.740 --> 00:31:50.492
If I can't, I should die.

00:31:59.126 --> 00:32:00.710
Please come tell me...

00:32:03.463 --> 00:32:04.506
what you mean by that.

00:32:04.589 --> 00:32:05.757
Huh?

00:32:10.554 --> 00:32:11.596
Even if I told you,

00:32:13.640 --> 00:32:15.350
you wouldn't understand.

00:32:15.934 --> 00:32:16.935
Mr. Hwang.

00:32:19.229 --> 00:32:21.773
-[indistinct murmuring]
-[camera shutters clicking]

00:32:23.692 --> 00:32:25.777
-[Junyoung] Stop filming!
-[Kyungjin] Stop filming!

00:32:25.861 --> 00:32:27.320
-[Junyoung] I said, stop filming!
-[Kyungjin] Stop!

00:32:27.404 --> 00:32:28.613
No filming. Cameras down.

00:32:28.697 --> 00:32:30.282
-Police! No filming!
-[Junyoung] Cameras down!

00:32:30.365 --> 00:32:32.325
[Kyungjin] Get down from there!
No filming!

00:32:32.409 --> 00:32:33.952
Lower your cameras.

00:32:34.035 --> 00:32:36.037
-[Junyoung] Cameras down!
-[Kyungjin] Lower your cameras!

00:32:36.121 --> 00:32:37.414
-Stop filming.
-[Junyoung] No filming.

00:32:37.497 --> 00:32:39.916
-Cameras down!
-[Kyungjin] Lower your cameras!

00:32:53.180 --> 00:32:54.389
They're here.

00:32:56.516 --> 00:32:57.684
[Junyoung] Lower your cameras!

00:33:09.237 --> 00:33:10.322
-Stop filming.
-[heavy thud, squelch]

00:33:10.405 --> 00:33:12.032
-[reporters gasps]
-[reporter 1] What's that?

00:33:13.658 --> 00:33:15.118
-[swears softly]
-[camera shutters clicking]

00:33:18.330 --> 00:33:19.748
[Kyungjin] Stop filming!

00:33:19.831 --> 00:33:21.917
No filming! Your cameras!

00:33:22.000 --> 00:33:23.960
Turn off your cameras!
You can't film this!

00:33:24.044 --> 00:33:25.837
Turn off your cameras!

00:33:25.921 --> 00:33:27.422
-[reporter 2] Why?
-Stop filming!

00:33:27.505 --> 00:33:29.090
-Stop filming!
-Hello? I'm at...

00:33:29.174 --> 00:33:30.634
The suicidal person just...

00:33:30.717 --> 00:33:33.220
Yes, Myeongun-dong.
Please could you hurry?

00:33:33.303 --> 00:33:34.512
[Kyungjin] Lower your cameras!

00:33:34.596 --> 00:33:37.015
You can't film this.
Turn off your cameras!

00:33:37.098 --> 00:33:38.934
-Turn off your cameras!
-[breath trembling]

00:33:39.851 --> 00:33:41.853
[Kyungjin] Lower your cameras!
Stop filming!

00:33:41.937 --> 00:33:43.688
Stop filming! You can't film this!

00:33:43.772 --> 00:33:44.773
Stop filming!

00:33:44.856 --> 00:33:46.399
Stop filming!

00:33:49.319 --> 00:33:50.695
Mmm.

00:33:53.657 --> 00:33:55.075
CHASING THE TRUTH OF THAT DAY

00:33:55.158 --> 00:33:57.285
SPECIAL REPORT
ON JIN ISOO'S MURDER ALLEGATIONS

00:33:58.662 --> 00:34:00.747
I stand before you again
after a long absence.

00:34:00.830 --> 00:34:02.249
Given the gravity of the case,

00:34:02.332 --> 00:34:05.627
I will personally lead
today's special broadcast.

00:34:05.710 --> 00:34:10.799
Last night, a man fell from a building
at a deserted construction site.

00:34:11.633 --> 00:34:13.885
To understand the full scope of this case,

00:34:13.969 --> 00:34:17.097
we must begin
with the murder of Kim Younghwan.

00:34:17.180 --> 00:34:20.392
Ten days ago, Mr. Kim Younghwan,
the CEO of a film production company,

00:34:20.475 --> 00:34:22.018
was brutally murdered.

00:34:22.852 --> 00:34:25.730
The prime suspect was
the victim's close friend

00:34:25.814 --> 00:34:28.108
and the only person present at the scene,

00:34:28.191 --> 00:34:29.776
Detective Jin Isoo.

00:34:30.694 --> 00:34:32.404
There was compelling evidence,

00:34:32.487 --> 00:34:35.365
but Detective Jin was released
without charge a few days later.

00:34:35.448 --> 00:34:36.783
[Mujin] I thought it was unjust.

00:34:36.866 --> 00:34:39.995
All the evidence pointed to him,
but he was released without charge.

00:34:40.078 --> 00:34:43.206
I still think Jin Isoo is the killer.

00:34:43.290 --> 00:34:47.002
Gangha Violent Crime next arrested
a new suspect, Mr. Cho.

00:34:47.085 --> 00:34:48.878
However, in just a day,

00:34:48.962 --> 00:34:52.007
he was poisoned to death while in custody.

00:34:52.090 --> 00:34:53.800
Finally, last night,

00:34:53.883 --> 00:34:56.511
a new suspect, Mr. Hwang,

00:34:56.594 --> 00:34:59.097
fell to his death
while fleeing from police.

00:34:59.764 --> 00:35:02.559
Can we really call this a coincidence?

00:35:02.642 --> 00:35:06.479
Some speculate that in an attempt
to divert suspicion from himself,

00:35:06.563 --> 00:35:09.691
Detective Jin tried to frame Mr. Hwang,

00:35:09.774 --> 00:35:12.986
who has no connection to this case,
as a new suspect.

00:35:15.155 --> 00:35:16.156
Was his hand

00:35:17.907 --> 00:35:20.368
reaching out to save him?

00:35:20.452 --> 00:35:22.996
Or was it to push him?

00:35:27.626 --> 00:35:28.835
-[TV beeps]
-[remote clatters]

00:35:31.296 --> 00:35:34.215
She's spouting
whatever nonsense she wants.

00:35:34.299 --> 00:35:36.551
She stepped in herself
as a former news anchor.

00:35:44.976 --> 00:35:46.061
By the way,

00:35:49.105 --> 00:35:50.523
how did Hwang Jongsu know?

00:35:52.525 --> 00:35:54.527
It looked like he was running away.

00:35:55.779 --> 00:35:58.073
How did he know that we suspected him?

00:36:12.921 --> 00:36:13.963
Team 1.

00:36:17.550 --> 00:36:21.012
Effective immediately,
you are all suspended.

00:36:23.139 --> 00:36:25.767
Joo Hyera, do you have something to say?

00:36:30.647 --> 00:36:34.359
The suspect in Kim Younghwan's murder case
died while in custody,

00:36:35.735 --> 00:36:38.780
a victim's dead body was delivered here,

00:36:38.863 --> 00:36:42.909
and the suspect in that murder
committed suicide.

00:36:44.911 --> 00:36:48.415
You deserve to be suspended, don't you?

00:37:00.802 --> 00:37:01.886
Get lost, all of you!

00:37:01.970 --> 00:37:03.972
Stay out of my sight!

00:37:17.110 --> 00:37:18.236
Chief.

00:37:20.405 --> 00:37:21.781
Just stand down for now.

00:37:21.865 --> 00:37:23.241
-But--
-Hyera.

00:37:23.324 --> 00:37:25.952
If you keep this up,
you could lose your job.

00:37:26.035 --> 00:37:28.288
How will you catch
Yu Seongwon as a civilian?

00:37:44.471 --> 00:37:45.472
Come in.

00:37:50.018 --> 00:37:52.854
-[door closes]
-I don't think it's even been 10 minutes

00:37:53.605 --> 00:37:55.815
since I told you to stay out of my sight.

00:37:56.441 --> 00:37:58.693
I'm here to make your wish come true, sir.

00:38:10.955 --> 00:38:12.332
LETTER OF RESIGNATION

00:38:12.415 --> 00:38:14.334
-[hand thuds on table]
-[exhales softly]

00:38:15.502 --> 00:38:16.503
I'll leave.

00:38:18.171 --> 00:38:19.589
That's your wish, isn't it?

00:38:20.924 --> 00:38:25.011
So leave Detective Joo,
Detective Park, and Detective Choi alone.

00:38:26.304 --> 00:38:28.181
They're already done for.

00:38:28.807 --> 00:38:30.892
There's going to be
a disciplinary hearing.

00:38:31.518 --> 00:38:32.936
You can all leave hand in hand.

00:38:35.855 --> 00:38:37.732
What exactly did we do wrong?

00:38:39.192 --> 00:38:41.945
If anyone did anything wrong here,
it wasn't us.

00:38:43.696 --> 00:38:45.156
It was you, sir.

00:38:49.118 --> 00:38:52.163
When we went,
Hwang Jongsu was already on the run.

00:38:52.831 --> 00:38:54.791
As if he had already been warned.

00:38:58.837 --> 00:39:00.672
I checked at the security office.

00:39:00.755 --> 00:39:02.465
GANGHA POLICE STATION SECURITY OFFICE

00:39:17.105 --> 00:39:18.439
Who did you call?

00:39:20.108 --> 00:39:22.944
It was just a work call.

00:39:23.027 --> 00:39:24.028
[Isoo] Sir.

00:39:25.363 --> 00:39:26.906
Do you know who Hwang Jongsu is?

00:39:28.324 --> 00:39:30.201
He's Yu Seongwon's closest associate.

00:39:31.160 --> 00:39:33.705
He's protected Yu Seongwon
since Seongwon was a child.

00:39:34.497 --> 00:39:37.333
If we're right and Yu Seongwon
committed murder in his studio,

00:39:38.543 --> 00:39:41.379
Hwang Jongsu is both a witness
to everything and an accomplice.

00:39:44.465 --> 00:39:46.217
Now do you understand what you did?

00:39:48.970 --> 00:39:50.889
You leaked confidential information.

00:39:51.890 --> 00:39:53.057
If you touch my team,

00:39:54.767 --> 00:39:56.019
I'm going to expose it.

00:40:05.236 --> 00:40:06.446
-[sighs]

00:40:31.763 --> 00:40:32.805
Detective Joo.

00:40:33.681 --> 00:40:34.682
What do we do now?

00:40:37.393 --> 00:40:39.145
You'll be fine.

00:40:39.729 --> 00:40:40.980
I'll find a way to stop it.

00:40:41.064 --> 00:40:44.359
Hey, you're a detective.
This can happen while working a case.

00:40:44.442 --> 00:40:45.818
No, that's not what I meant.

00:40:46.694 --> 00:40:47.987
How do we catch Yu Seongwon?

00:40:50.281 --> 00:40:52.575
The suspect's dead, and we're suspended.

00:40:53.284 --> 00:40:54.911
Yu Seongwon won't stop.

00:40:58.164 --> 00:40:59.624
What if he kills someone again?

00:41:02.043 --> 00:41:03.252
-[sighs wearily]
-[door opens]

00:41:04.504 --> 00:41:06.589
Why is everyone so down, huh?

00:41:07.548 --> 00:41:09.717
What's this? You're clocking out already?

00:41:09.801 --> 00:41:11.469
Unpack and get back to work.

00:41:12.136 --> 00:41:13.304
I'm the only one leaving.

00:41:13.388 --> 00:41:14.806
-What?
-What?

00:41:14.889 --> 00:41:16.140
What are you talking about?

00:41:16.224 --> 00:41:17.892
I made a deal with the police chief.

00:41:18.559 --> 00:41:20.436
I'm the one he hates most.

00:41:21.396 --> 00:41:22.605
I'll leave,

00:41:23.398 --> 00:41:24.857
and you three won't be suspended.

00:41:26.901 --> 00:41:28.277
[sighs] Jin Isoo.

00:41:28.361 --> 00:41:30.279
You guys don't have anywhere to go.

00:41:30.363 --> 00:41:32.240
I've got plenty of other options.

00:41:35.076 --> 00:41:36.077
Bro.

00:41:37.620 --> 00:41:39.580
-Are you really going to quit?
-Yes.

00:41:40.331 --> 00:41:42.792
I just went ahead
and handed the chief my resignation.

00:41:43.835 --> 00:41:44.961
[Junyoung] Hey.

00:41:45.044 --> 00:41:47.422
What do you think you're doing?

00:41:49.007 --> 00:41:50.883
This case started because of me.

00:41:51.718 --> 00:41:53.803
The press will come after me, too.

00:41:54.637 --> 00:41:56.097
Staying will only make it harder.

00:41:59.350 --> 00:42:00.601
I'll clear this up later.

00:42:00.685 --> 00:42:03.062
Take care. I'm a free man now.

00:42:07.316 --> 00:42:08.484
-[door closes]
-[sighs softly]

00:42:14.073 --> 00:42:15.158
Jin Isoo.

00:42:20.955 --> 00:42:22.123
I'm sorry.

00:42:25.001 --> 00:42:26.919
Why do you look so defeated?

00:42:28.629 --> 00:42:30.840
I'll go out and do what I can
on the outside.

00:42:31.507 --> 00:42:32.508
You should

00:42:33.843 --> 00:42:35.261
hold things down here.

00:42:41.976 --> 00:42:43.853
I'm not giving up on Yu Seongwon.

00:42:44.437 --> 00:42:45.938
I'll catch him no matter what.

00:42:57.116 --> 00:42:58.743
Mr. Jin Isoo is here.

00:42:58.826 --> 00:43:00.369
Hello!

00:43:01.871 --> 00:43:03.581
Are you here to complain?

00:43:03.664 --> 00:43:05.958
No, I came to thank you.

00:43:06.042 --> 00:43:08.044
I'm a civilian now, thanks to you.

00:43:09.420 --> 00:43:10.880
I quit being a cop.

00:43:11.881 --> 00:43:14.258
You even went on the air
to give a special broadcast,

00:43:14.342 --> 00:43:16.177
and I got absolutely roasted.

00:43:17.220 --> 00:43:19.180
So I thought I'd bring you a gift.

00:43:20.014 --> 00:43:21.015
Here.

00:43:25.478 --> 00:43:27.980
Go on, open it.
I went to all this trouble.

00:43:32.735 --> 00:43:34.237
It's custom-made.

00:43:37.865 --> 00:43:38.908
Is this gold?

00:43:38.991 --> 00:43:40.201
Yes.

00:43:40.284 --> 00:43:42.328
One for you, one for Seongwon.

00:43:42.411 --> 00:43:45.623
If you ever want to turn yourself in,
wear that to Gangha Police Station.

00:43:46.499 --> 00:43:50.044
[sighs] Chairman Jin Myeongchul
was a good man,

00:43:50.128 --> 00:43:51.254
but his son's a letdown.

00:43:51.337 --> 00:43:53.965
You should worry about your own son.

00:43:54.757 --> 00:43:56.801
How did you bring him up to be a murderer?

00:43:59.846 --> 00:44:01.347
Nothing's holding me back now.

00:44:02.014 --> 00:44:04.475
Being a detective
comes with a lot of restrictions.

00:44:04.559 --> 00:44:08.020
I need to play by the rules
and keep the brass happy.

00:44:08.604 --> 00:44:09.856
I don't have that anymore.

00:44:14.026 --> 00:44:17.321
Just watch and see how far I can go.

00:44:41.971 --> 00:44:43.681
Are you busy, Mr. Chairman?

00:44:44.390 --> 00:44:46.267
What brings you here?

00:44:47.226 --> 00:44:48.728
You were eating.

00:44:52.732 --> 00:44:54.483
Are you here because of the broadcast?

00:44:55.443 --> 00:44:57.820
I filed a correction
with the arbitration commission.

00:44:57.904 --> 00:44:59.363
They won't listen.

00:44:59.906 --> 00:45:00.907
What?

00:45:02.533 --> 00:45:03.826
Chairwoman Jeong Taeseon

00:45:04.827 --> 00:45:06.120
was just using me.

00:45:07.538 --> 00:45:08.539
Why?

00:45:08.623 --> 00:45:11.626
-Because her son is a killer...
-[gasps]

00:45:11.709 --> 00:45:13.252
...and I'm going to catch him.

00:45:13.336 --> 00:45:15.338
What are you talking about?

00:45:15.421 --> 00:45:18.674
The artist Yu Seongwon is a killer?

00:45:19.342 --> 00:45:22.178
Yes, a serial killer.

00:45:22.261 --> 00:45:24.513
So I got fired today.

00:45:24.597 --> 00:45:25.598
What?

00:45:25.681 --> 00:45:26.682
I'm unemployed.

00:45:28.017 --> 00:45:30.811
I did give in my resignation,
but I was basically fired.

00:45:30.895 --> 00:45:34.273
Then what are you going to do?

00:45:35.399 --> 00:45:36.817
[Isoo] Mmm...

00:45:38.486 --> 00:45:39.487
Mr. Choi.

00:45:40.696 --> 00:45:42.573
Don't we have some white hackers here?

00:45:43.157 --> 00:45:46.285
We don't have any on staff,
but we have people under contract.

00:45:47.078 --> 00:45:48.079
Set me up with them.

00:45:49.330 --> 00:45:53.000
I'm going to arrest
Yu Seongwon and Jeong Taeseon both.

00:45:53.584 --> 00:45:57.004
All right. I'll give them a call.

00:45:58.005 --> 00:45:59.006
Ah.

00:45:59.507 --> 00:46:01.384
Our subsidiaries advertise on UBS, right?

00:46:01.467 --> 00:46:02.802
Cancel everything.

00:46:02.885 --> 00:46:04.595
I'm going to sue for defamation.

00:46:07.348 --> 00:46:09.725
-Is that sushi?
-What? Oh.

00:46:12.103 --> 00:46:13.896
-[chuckles]
-[sighs contentedly]

00:46:46.345 --> 00:46:47.346
Mmm!

00:46:48.180 --> 00:46:49.348
Detective Jin Isoo!

00:46:50.683 --> 00:46:52.518
-I'm a fan.
-Right.

00:46:54.478 --> 00:46:55.479
Really?

00:46:57.815 --> 00:46:59.025
Yes.

00:46:59.817 --> 00:47:01.402
Did you really kill Kim Younghwan?

00:47:02.153 --> 00:47:03.154
No.

00:47:03.237 --> 00:47:05.740
Oh, if you did, that'd be a killer story.

00:47:06.449 --> 00:47:08.117
Can you stop talking about killing?

00:47:08.200 --> 00:47:10.077
I heard you had a request for us.

00:47:10.161 --> 00:47:11.162
Yes.

00:47:12.913 --> 00:47:14.081
Find this person for me.

00:47:14.874 --> 00:47:18.586
I think he's a close associate
of UBS's Jeong Taeseon.

00:47:18.669 --> 00:47:20.379
He could be a former employee.

00:47:20.463 --> 00:47:22.381
I can't find him in the company records.

00:47:22.465 --> 00:47:24.300
Did this guy kill Kim Younghwan?

00:47:24.383 --> 00:47:25.426
No.

00:47:27.470 --> 00:47:28.846
But he is a murderer.

00:47:29.930 --> 00:47:32.016
He killed the guy
who killed Kim Younghwan.

00:47:32.099 --> 00:47:34.268
-Oh!
-Oh! [chuckling]

00:47:35.728 --> 00:47:37.521
Can you find him without a name?

00:47:38.564 --> 00:47:39.690
-Of course!
-Of course!

00:47:40.733 --> 00:47:43.569
But before that, can I get your autograph?

00:47:44.278 --> 00:47:45.321
Me too.

00:47:47.114 --> 00:47:48.908
[scoffs] Bring me a pen.

00:47:50.993 --> 00:47:52.995
JIN ISOO

00:47:55.289 --> 00:47:56.457
JIN ISOO

00:48:03.631 --> 00:48:05.257
DIRECTOR KIM IS HERE

00:48:13.391 --> 00:48:15.393
Hansu pulled all their advertising.

00:48:17.311 --> 00:48:19.021
I know. I heard.

00:48:19.105 --> 00:48:20.815
They're even threatening a lawsuit.

00:48:20.898 --> 00:48:22.233
We should issue a correction.

00:48:22.316 --> 00:48:24.026
No, just leave it.

00:48:24.110 --> 00:48:25.152
Pardon?

00:48:25.236 --> 00:48:27.988
I said leave it. I'll handle it!

00:48:28.572 --> 00:48:29.782
Yes, ma'am.

00:48:40.668 --> 00:48:43.629
RETURN II
YU SEONGWON'S SOLO EXHIBITION

00:48:43.712 --> 00:48:45.172
[director] Mr. Yu, welcome.

00:48:45.256 --> 00:48:47.091
Yes, hello.

00:48:47.174 --> 00:48:50.094
You're as handsome as always.
Have you been well?

00:48:50.177 --> 00:48:51.887
Yes. I hope you've been well, too.

00:48:52.471 --> 00:48:54.849
I've been so busy
getting the exhibition ready.

00:48:54.932 --> 00:48:56.934
Come this way. We've set up the pieces.

00:49:05.276 --> 00:49:06.777
What do you think?

00:49:12.783 --> 00:49:14.243
For this exhibition,

00:49:18.873 --> 00:49:20.541
that is the main piece.

00:49:23.169 --> 00:49:26.755
It needs to be the first thing
people see when they walk in.

00:49:27.715 --> 00:49:28.799
So vivid,

00:49:29.758 --> 00:49:32.052
it almost seems alive.

00:49:32.136 --> 00:49:33.387
FULL BLOOM, LIFE YET TO BLOOM

00:49:36.098 --> 00:49:37.099
You get what I mean?

00:49:37.892 --> 00:49:39.185
[chuckles softly] Yes.

00:49:45.274 --> 00:49:47.318
JEONG TAESEON

00:49:50.446 --> 00:49:52.740
-[Taeseon] Come to the office right now.
-[line disconnects]

00:50:02.291 --> 00:50:03.667
We're meeting too often lately.

00:50:08.255 --> 00:50:10.174
I've got a plane ready,
so leave right now.

00:50:14.637 --> 00:50:16.889
I can't cover for you any more than this.

00:50:19.058 --> 00:50:21.936
If they look into Mr. Hwang,
everything will link back to you.

00:50:22.019 --> 00:50:23.312
Then there's nothing I can do.

00:50:25.147 --> 00:50:27.399
Just stay out until I clean everything up.

00:50:29.360 --> 00:50:31.445
I'm asking you.

00:50:32.112 --> 00:50:33.405
Please!

00:50:42.456 --> 00:50:44.333
If you really want it, then beg me.

00:50:52.091 --> 00:50:53.092
Okay, fine.

00:50:54.009 --> 00:50:56.470
It was a joke.

00:50:58.222 --> 00:50:59.223
Fine.

00:51:00.766 --> 00:51:01.767
I'll leave.

00:51:04.979 --> 00:51:08.315
Okay, find out when and where
UBS' private jet is leaving today.

00:51:08.399 --> 00:51:09.775
-Okay.
-Okay.

00:51:13.696 --> 00:51:16.240
-[keyboard key clacks]
-[rapid digital beeping]

00:51:19.326 --> 00:51:21.120
In two hours. Business aviation terminal.

00:51:28.919 --> 00:51:29.920
Hello?

00:51:30.754 --> 00:51:32.840
Yu Seongwon is flying out in two hours.

00:51:33.382 --> 00:51:34.383
Where is he going?

00:51:34.466 --> 00:51:37.261
[Isoo] I don't know,
but he's flying on a private jet.

00:51:38.429 --> 00:51:39.930
Just go arrest him.

00:51:40.014 --> 00:51:41.015
What will you do?

00:51:41.098 --> 00:51:45.227
Dr. Seo said Yu Seongwon
would have kept all the evidence.

00:51:45.311 --> 00:51:47.396
I'll go to his studio to find them.

00:51:52.526 --> 00:51:53.527
Get ready to move out.

00:51:53.611 --> 00:51:55.446
-Yes, ma'am.
-Yes, ma'am.

00:54:30.142 --> 00:54:31.727
-[switch clicks]
-[light beeps]

00:55:03.926 --> 00:55:05.594
ECSTASY
A BREATHLESS FALL

00:55:10.390 --> 00:55:12.059
JO NAYEONG
YU SEONGWON'S MODEL

00:55:27.741 --> 00:55:29.576
CHOI YEONGMIN
YU SEONGWON'S MODEL

00:55:29.660 --> 00:55:31.578
CLIMAX
LIGHT SCATTERED ACROSS THE UNIVERSE

00:55:44.883 --> 00:55:47.719
[Isoo] What's with the pebbles
and why stick the reed in?

00:55:47.803 --> 00:55:49.680
DISSOLUTION
THE SILENCE OF WHISPERING REEDS

00:55:51.515 --> 00:55:52.683
KIM HEEJUN
YU SEONGWON'S JUNIOR

00:56:03.610 --> 00:56:05.404
FULL BLOOM, LIFE YET TO BLOOM

00:56:17.249 --> 00:56:18.959
JEONG MINJAE
FORMER DETECTIVE

00:56:34.600 --> 00:56:36.602
-[siren blaring]
-[cell phone vibrating]

00:56:38.270 --> 00:56:39.688
[Isoo] It's me.

00:56:39.771 --> 00:56:42.149
I found Yu Seongwon's real studio.

00:56:42.899 --> 00:56:45.193
All the evidence is here.

00:56:49.865 --> 00:56:50.949
He found the evidence.

00:56:57.539 --> 00:56:59.374
-[engine revving]
-[tires screeching]

00:57:04.212 --> 00:57:06.798
Chief, I'm inside Yu Seongwon's studio.

00:57:07.382 --> 00:57:08.967
There's a basement here.

00:57:09.593 --> 00:57:13.221
I found the victims' belongings
and photographic evidence.

00:57:13.930 --> 00:57:15.849
I'll send Forensics over, so wait there.

00:57:15.932 --> 00:57:16.933
Yes, sir.

00:57:41.541 --> 00:57:43.418
-[engine roaring]
-[siren approaching]

00:57:46.463 --> 00:57:47.756
-[siren stops]

00:57:53.679 --> 00:57:55.263
Are you here to say goodbye?

00:57:56.390 --> 00:57:59.267
Or have you grown attached to me?

00:58:04.815 --> 00:58:06.942
-[Hyera] Yu Seongwon.
-[handcuffs clicking]

00:58:08.819 --> 00:58:11.238
For the murders
of Jo Nayeong, Choi Yeongmin,

00:58:11.321 --> 00:58:14.074
Kim Heejun, and Jeong Minjae...

00:58:16.243 --> 00:58:17.911
I am placing you under arrest.

00:58:22.999 --> 00:58:24.543
You sound confident.

00:58:26.253 --> 00:58:27.879
Is it for certain this time?

00:58:29.923 --> 00:58:31.383
Are you really sure

00:58:32.843 --> 00:58:34.302
you can catch me?

00:58:57.200 --> 00:58:58.702
RESIDENT REGISTRATION CARD

00:59:02.748 --> 00:59:04.791
JIN ISOO

00:59:17.220 --> 00:59:19.181
WHAT I HAD DRAWN WASN'T A HAT

00:59:19.264 --> 00:59:22.142
YOU ALWAYS HAVE TO EXPLAIN
EVERYTHING TO GROWN-UPS

00:59:32.652 --> 00:59:33.862
We got him.

00:59:34.654 --> 00:59:35.655
Okay.

00:59:36.573 --> 00:59:37.699
I'll be there soon.

00:59:47.375 --> 00:59:50.587
[Seongwon] After all,
you're my Little Prince.

01:00:10.732 --> 01:00:12.067
Where is Isoo right now?

01:00:17.030 --> 01:00:18.698
Did he go to my exhibition hall?

01:00:31.753 --> 01:00:33.839
-[grunts]

01:00:35.090 --> 01:00:36.550
-[clattering]
-[panting]

01:00:38.426 --> 01:00:40.011
[Isoo] Ah!

01:00:40.095 --> 01:00:41.805
I've been looking everywhere for you.

01:00:41.888 --> 01:00:43.765
Here you are, making a dramatic entrance.

01:00:49.062 --> 01:00:50.480
-[heavy thud]
-[glass shattering]

01:00:56.027 --> 01:00:57.195
-[sharp whoosh]
-[Isoo exclaims]

01:01:10.625 --> 01:01:12.043
-[clatters]
-[Isoo grunts]

01:01:18.758 --> 01:01:20.010
-[Isoo grunts]
-[heavy thud]

01:01:27.434 --> 01:01:28.768
-[blunt thud]
-[high-pitched ringing]

01:01:39.696 --> 01:01:41.364
-[hammer clangs]
-[exhales in relief]

01:01:48.246 --> 01:01:50.040
Jin Isoo is here inside the studio.

01:01:50.832 --> 01:01:51.958
Burn him with it.

01:02:43.385 --> 01:02:44.386
FLEX X COP 2
EPISODE 13

01:02:44.469 --> 01:02:45.804
WHAT FATE AWAITS ISOO?

01:03:20.964 --> 01:03:22.007
[Hyera] Chief.

01:03:22.090 --> 01:03:23.299
What about Jin Isoo?

01:03:23.383 --> 01:03:26.261
You'll wake up, right?
I know you won't let this break you.

01:03:26.344 --> 01:03:27.637
Jin Isoo is still alive.

01:03:27.721 --> 01:03:29.305
When it's done, leave the country.

01:03:29.389 --> 01:03:31.891
[Taeseon's assistant] The basement
was destroyed. We won't find any evidence.

01:03:31.975 --> 01:03:34.519
He's on the move with Yu Seongwon.
We're following them.

01:03:35.854 --> 01:03:37.439
[Hyera] Detective Park! Detective Choi!

01:03:37.522 --> 01:03:39.315
Yu Seongwon's gone. He ditched the car.

01:03:39.399 --> 01:03:41.109
There's no choice. I'll finish this.

01:03:41.985 --> 01:03:44.612
Do you get it now?
This is the death you love so much.

01:03:46.281 --> 01:03:47.365
[Isoo] Yu Seongwon!

01:03:47.449 --> 01:03:48.450
You crazy bastard.

01:03:55.749 --> 01:03:59.794
NUMBER 1 SAFETY!! NUMBER 1 PUBLIC ORDER!!
GANGHA POLICE STATION

01:05:05.819 --> 01:05:07.362
Should I just disappear?

01:05:11.199 --> 01:05:13.701
Should I make one final piece?

01:05:19.833 --> 01:05:21.835
Translated by Hyesoo Lee